          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An increase in perceived regional escalation drives risk‑off reallocations by global investors, who withdraw capital from higher‑risk eurozone assets (especially periphery credits) into safe‑haven assets, raising net capital outflow rates." />
