          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An uptick in perceived regional escalation prompts Turkey to increase defense diplomacy—deploying naval assets, hosting bilateral/multilateral security talks and offering or seeking defence cooperation to deter spillover and reassure partners." />
