          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Restricted access to critical chips and rare earths (driven by tech competition) prompts affected powers to intensify state‑level outreach and bargain with Gulf suppliers and intermediaries, increasing coordinated diplomatic engagement aimed at stabilizing ties." />
