          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained rises in eurozone sovereign yields raise borrowing costs and near‑term fiscal strain, prompting governments to curtail costly overseas diplomatic initiatives and crisis mediation capacity, reducing coordinated de‑escalation efforts." />
