          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sharp rise in eurozone sovereign yields forces governments to reallocate political capital and military/diplomatic resources to domestic economic stabilization, weakening coordinated EU deterrence and opening space for increased great‑power maneuvering around the Russia–Ukraine front." />
